Every Safety \\& Tolerability section\line \line ## Rules\line \line ### Rule 1: Adverse Event Frequency Thresholds\line Classify adverse events by frequency:\line - Very Common (\u8805\'3d10%)\line - Common (1-10%)\line - Uncommon (0.1-1%)\line 
